    "description": "<p>Cable Dispensers contain a special liquid that instantly solidifies upon contact with either atmosphere or vacuum to form a tough, lightweight, flexible cable. The dispenser contains enough liquid for 15 meters (10 squares) of cable, and is refillable at authorized outlets. The cable has a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> score of 28, can safely support up to 560 kg, and it can be broken with a DC 24 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> check. </p>",
